# Calculate the Deterministic Slug

BTC 5m markets use a predictable URL based on Unix time.

```python
import time

# Get the current 5-minute window timestamp
now = int(time.time())
window_ts = now - (now % 300) 
slug = f"btc-updown-5m-{window_ts}"
# Example URL: https://polymarket.com/event/btc-updown-5m-1771168800
```
